<section class="bv-block bv-authority">
<h2>BC Forged engineering and custom philosophy</h2>
<p>BC Forged specialises in fully custom forged wheels, offering a level of flexibility rarely found in off-the-shelf wheel brands. Each wheel is engineered to order, allowing precise control over size, offset, concavity and brake clearance.</p>
<p>By combining advanced forging processes with CNC machining and strict quality control, BC Forged delivers wheels that balance lightweight performance with exceptional strength — suitable for everything from daily-driven performance cars to dedicated track builds.</p>
</section>
<!-- Product categories -->
<section class="bv-block bv-categories">
<h2>BC Forged wheel categories</h2>
<h3>Monoblock forged wheels</h3>
<p>Single-piece forged wheels offering maximum strength, reduced weight and clean, purposeful designs. Ideal for high-performance and track-focused applications.</p>
<h3>Multi-piece forged wheels</h3>
<p>Modular forged wheel designs that allow additional visual customisation while maintaining forged strength and precise fitment.</p>
<h3>Custom finishes &amp; specifications</h3>
<p>A wide selection of finishes, colours and machining options ensures each BC Forged wheel set is tailored perfectly to the vehicle and owner’s vision.</p>
</section>
<!-- Why BaanVelgen -->
<section class="bv-block bv-why">
<h2>Why buy BC Forged at BaanVelgen</h2>
<ul>
<li>Extensive experience with forged wheel specifications</li>
