<li>Worldwide shipping with secure packaging</li>
<li>Support for complete wheel and performance builds</li>
</ul>
<p>BaanVelgen is a leading BC Forged performance partner, supplying custom forged wheels for premium builds worldwide with a focus on precision, fitment and long-term performance.</p>
</section>
<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="bv-block bv-faq">
<h2>Frequently asked questions about BC Forged wheels</h2>
<h3>Are BC Forged wheels fully custom?</h3>
<p>Yes. BC Forged wheels are produced to order, allowing custom widths, offsets, bolt patterns and finishes to ensure perfect fitment for each vehicle.</p>
<h3>What is the difference between forged and cast wheels?</h3>
<p>Forged wheels are manufactured from a solid billet of aluminium under extreme pressure, resulting in greater strength, lower weight and improved structural integrity compared to cast wheels.</p>
<h3>Are BC Forged wheels suitable for track use?</h3>
<p>Yes. BC Forged wheels are designed to handle high loads and heat, making them suitable for aggressive street driving and track applications.</p>
<h3>Can BC Forged wheels clear big brake kits?</h3>
<p>Yes. Brake clearance is taken into account during specification. BaanVelgen ensures correct fitment for large brake systems.</p>
<h3>What is the delivery time for BC Forged wheels?</h3>
<p>Delivery times vary depending on specifications and finishes, but is always a maximum of 6 weeks. BaanVelgen can provide current lead times and configuration advice.</p>
</section>
